cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it with the metadata below, together with the
  miRPathDB 2027 article in Nucleic Acids Research, which describes the database whose tables it computes.
title: "miRPathDB 2027: pipeline of release v2027.1"
type: software
authors:
