license: MIT
version: "2027.1"
commit: aeef54ba64aa818a04237fad837f9ae26b19ee69
abstract: >-
  The analysis pipeline of miRPathDB release 2027.1 (tag v2027.1): miRNA target genes from miRTarBase 9.0,
  DIANA-TarBase v9, TargetScan 8 and miRDB 6.0 in cumulative High, Medium and Low evidence tiers, and
  over-representation analysis of GO, Reactome and WikiPathways with clusterProfiler for human, mouse, rat
  and rhesus macaque, with Benjamini-Hochberg adjustment over the full pathway family.
keywords:
  - microRNA
  - miRNA target genes
  - pathway enrichment
  - over-representation analysis
  - database
  - reproducibility
